WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.310
<i>What a refreshing morning.</i>

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.650
<i>Maybe something good will happen today.</i>

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.990
SCIENCE LAB

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:44.660
What...

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:49.670
You.

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:52.750
EPISODE 10
EVEN I'M USEFUL
ONCE IN A WHILE

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:53.880
The baseball team manager who called me
"Slipper Man" before the Flower Dance.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.800
Stare...

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:04.270
I guess you couldn't help
but remember my cuteness, Kisaragi.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:07.890
But, just in case, I'll introduce myself.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:11.900
Clean out your ears, and listen closely!

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:16.110
I'm both the baseball team manager
and a super-idol!

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:20.610
The first-year who everyone loves, Tampopo!

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:24.410
<i>I see. This girl is a moron.</i>

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:25.490
Can I go?

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:28.290
Hey! Why are you being like that?

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:32.170
Come on. This will probably take a while,
so let's grab a seat over there.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:33.000
A seat...

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.670
<i>Hey, wait a second.</i>

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.130
<i>What is it doing here?</i>

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.590
<i>That bench!</i>

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:44.100
Um...

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:45.510
Just say it.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:48.600
First, would you sit next to me?

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:50.520
<i>Naturally.</i>

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:52.770
Um...

00:02:53.310 --> 00:03:00.450
uh, a-actually, there's something
I've had on my mind for a long time.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.740
<i>Yep. Same pattern as always.</i>

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:07.490
When I think about it,
I feel a burning in my chest and a tightness.

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:11.420
But I go to school excited every day. So...

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:15.170
<i>Yes, I know. Here's where you ask me
to do something extremely unpleasant.</i>

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.920
Kisaragi...

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:17.760
Yeah?

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:18.920
<i>Here it comes.</i>

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:24.760
Please help me get Sanshokuin and Oga
to be girlfriend-boyfriend!

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.890
<i>I can't do that!</i>

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:28.890
Sorry, but n—

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:33.150
It all started last year at the final game
of the regional baseball tournament!

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.150
<i>There it is! The singularity!</i>

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.530
At the time, the angelic me

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:42.570
was cheering on Nishikizuta High School, the school
I wanted to get into, from the third base stands.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:46.950
I was disappointed by the result,
but it was a wonderful game.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:53.170
"So next year,
I'll become this team's angelic manager.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:54.920
Congratulations!"

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:59.550
I wanted to say that to Oga,
so I waited for him at the south exit.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.380
<i>South exit?</i>

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.630
Then I saw him!

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:08.390
Oga was alone with a beautiful girl
at the south exit!

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:12.020
The girl and Oga
were giving each other a smoldering look!

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:17.900
That situation just screamed
that those two were definitely in love!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.110
<i>It wasn't love.
You have the wrong idea.</i>

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:22.320
But they're both so innocent
that they become bashful,

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.570
and their relationship
hasn't gone beyond that point.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:26.700
The poor kids!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:32.710
"So if I get a chance to support those two
behind the scenes, I'll grab it!

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:36.580
I'll help them form a lovely relationship!"
I made up my mind then!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:37.960
<i>I don't want to grab it.</i>

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:43.720
Since it was my request,
God smiled upon me without any hesitation

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:44.680
with the Flower Dance!

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.640
- The Flower Dance?
- Yes!

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.930
That's when I realized it!

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:54.440
The beautiful girl from that day
was Sumireko Sanshokuin, a student at our school!

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:56.940
How did you know that girl was Pansy?

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:01.440
All the members of the Flower Dance
would gather in the school library.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:06.070
In other words,
the final girl had to be Sanshokuin!

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.240
<i>There's no reason
for a moron to be that clever.</i>

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.330
So!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:13.120
Together, let's make them
the best boyfriend and girlfriend ever!

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:18.880
Because the way Oga plays
is strongly influenced by his mental state.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:24.220
If he's dating someone, the power of love
will bring out his talent even more!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:28.890
S-So you're thinking about the baseball team
from the manager's standpoint.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:34.180
And if the team goes to Koushien,
my popularity will soar like never before!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:39.020
It's as good as a guarantee that I'll become
a top-class international idol!

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.360
<i>So it's that standpoint.</i>

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:44.150
Nishikizuta High School will go to Koushien,

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:48.030
and I'll wipe my gleaming tears away,
moved by the great battle.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:51.490
The rubes, in turn,
will wipe their tears away, moved by me.

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:53.330
<i>Calm down, rube.</i>

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.160
I can't wait!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:58.870
In that moment,
"Wata Guests" will overflow the world.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.710
<i>What are "Wata Guests"?</i>

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:05.460
<i>Something that loves you? Someone like you?</i>

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:06.670
Hey...

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.050
why would I help you?

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:16.640
You see Sanshokuin every day in the library,
and you're Oga's best friend and my slave.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.440
<i>I've never heard that last part before.</i>

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:23.320
In short, you're just the person I need for this.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:27.610
<i>There's nothing I'd like to do more than laugh
in her face, but she knows Pansy's secret.</i>

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:28.950
Look.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.660
You can have my photo.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.660
I-I'm not especially interested.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.910
Incidentally, as a reward for success,

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:42.290
I'll give you more photos of me
posing this and that way.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:43.840
This and that way.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.090
All right, fine.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.210
I'll do it.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.050
I'll help you just this once.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.970
Then, why don't we start thinking
of a strategy right away?

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.430
Sounds good to me.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:59.020
I agree with the idea.
And it should make for an interesting article.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.310
Who are you?

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.310
Asunaro! What are you doing here?

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:06.320
I witnessed you getting dragged
into the science lab,

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:08.400
so I crawled in through that window.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:09.490
When?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:12.110
So why don't you two let me in on this?

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.120
No, this is kind of...

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.660
Actually, I'm with the school newspaper.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:22.080
If your plan works, I think
I'll do a special feature on you, Tampopo.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:25.790
Imagine how popular that could make you.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:28.010
Yes! Welcome to the operation!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.630
I knew you'd see it my way, Tampopo!
Thank you!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.090
You're welcome!

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:39.060
<i>A feature article would catapult me
past the thorns in my side, Hinata and Akino!</i>

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:44.020
<i>If Sanshokuin and Sun-chan hook up,
Joro will be mine!</i>

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:47.230
<i>This is horrible!</i>

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:51.450
Your skewers really are delicious, Tsubaki!

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:55.450
Eat a lot so you can start plotting your revenge
for next year's tournament!

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.580
Yeah! I'll win it next year for sure!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.790
All right! That's the spirit, Himawari!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.410
I'll be cheering you on, too.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:03.250
And me.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.000
Thanks, everyone!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:10.170
<i>Confirm their feelings during lunch, Kisaragi!</i>

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:14.890
<i>While you're doing that,
I'll come up with a humdinger of a plan!</i>

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:17.390
<i>Confirm their feelings.</i>

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:22.270
The skewers are great,
but your cookies are amazing too, Pansy!

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.350
Thanks, Sun-chan.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:27.480
<i>Maybe Sun-chan still has a thing for Pansy.</i>

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.500
What's wrong, President Cosmos?

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.210
Excuse me!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:47.330
A-Asunaro!

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.340
Yes, it's me.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.340
Long time no see, President Cosmos.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.380
L-Long time, no see.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:57.850
<i>There was trouble between Cosmos and
Asunaro around the time of the Flower Dance,</i>

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:00.180
<i>so this is a little awkward.</i>

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:04.600
President Cosmos,
let's let bygones be bygones.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:08.270
S-Sure. So, what's going on?

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:10.270
I need to speak with Joro.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:13.400
So let me borrow him!

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:15.530
Why did you suddenly show up?

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.570
I did what you asked.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:20.490
That was fast!
You're amazing, Asunaro. That's a big help.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:22.040
You're welcome!

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.700
Th-There's no need to cling to me!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:28.290
Even if I don't have a chance in hell,
I'm not giving up.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:37.890
<i>I'm sure you'll be lonely since you won't see me,
but the operation continues tomorrow.</i>

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:43.180
<i>I've got baseball after school, so I don't have
time to spend on someone like you.</i>

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:45.520
Hey, you.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:47.940
What's up, Sasanqua?

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:52.480
U-Um, on our next day off,
h-how about you and I...

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:53.860
With you?

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.530
AMUSEMENT PARK
ENTRANCE TICKET

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:00.450
Are you okay?

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:01.200
AMUSEMENT PARK
ENTRANCE TICKET

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.160
I'm fine!

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:05.540
I just got a menopausal disorder a little early!

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.120
Menopausal...

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.380
Are you sure you're okay?

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.540
I said I am!

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:12.880
Oh, forget it!

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.420
Work hard at your job, okay?

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.260
R-Right.

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:17.930
Sasanqua!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:20.340
- Don't worry about it!
- You tried!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:22.810
<i>I'm such an idiot!</i>

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:28.190
How did Sasanqua know
I'm going to work today?

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.440
SCIENCE LAB

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.440
Ahem! All right!

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:35.190
Let's begin
the Tampopo Mighty Idol Project meeting!

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:38.240
<i>Is that the project I signed up for?</i>

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.820
First, based on your
reported observations of yesterday,

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:43.780
it's fair to say those two
have feelings for each other, right?

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:47.370
<i>I was pretty clear
that they're just normal friends.</i>

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:52.750
Now I just need to enact my wondrous plan!

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.960
This plan is revolutionary!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:58.470
I'm sure even Sanshokuin
will get so hyped up that...

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:02.510
<i>Exhilarating! Full throttle!
I couldn't stop if I wanted to!</i>

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:05.640
She'll scream it through the streets!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.270
<i>Cool your jets, revolutionary.</i>

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:12.810
So, Kisaragi, during your next free period,
put your arms around Sanshokuin!

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:13.520
Why?

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:17.230
Listen, to put the cherry on the top of love,

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.780
relationships must be stirred up
by a potential male rival.

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:23.740
Kisaragi, that rival is going to be you!

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:24.780
No, it's not!

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.040
You're too shy to do even that?

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.460
All right, should we go with plan B?

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:33.290
<i>Testing, testing!</i>

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.460
<i>It's a beautiful day in the neighborhood,
a beautiful day for this ideal angel.</i>

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:37.460
<i>Testing, testing!</i>

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:40.760
<i>Do you read me, Sergeant Kisaragi? Over!</i>

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.140
I read you. Over.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:46.720
<i>Then begin the mission, Sergeant! Over!</i>

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:48.020
Roger.

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:50.350
<i>Pain in the ass.</i>

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:53.600
I've sighted the subject, codenamed "P."

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:57.110
She's in the hallway looking melancholic. Over.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:58.360
<i>Lick her face!</i>

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:01.110
Accomplishing that
would be extremely difficult. Over.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:05.700
<i>Fine! Then go over there with a big smile
on your face, and talk to her. Over!</i>

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:07.620
Roger.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.080
<i>Go, go, go!</i>

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.040
H-Hey, Pansy.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:14.540
What are you doing here?

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:18.670
Your face looks like industrial waste
was put in a mixer with slime.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.880
<i>You are in love with me, aren't you?</i>

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:26.390
<i>Say, "Your beauty melted the slime!" Over!</i>

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:31.520
P-Pansy, you're so cute, that the slime melted.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.730
What's that earpiece?

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.190
<i>Say, "It's an ear hair
that won't stop growing!" Over!</i>

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.820
<i>The commander is a lunatic!</i>

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:41.570
Oh, don't worry about this.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.280
Sorry to keep you waiting, Pansy.

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:46.450
Huh?

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:47.580
President Cosmos?

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:48.910
What are you doing here, Joro?

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:51.790
Hey there!

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:54.040
- Sorry we're late!
- Huh?

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.000
Why is everyone gathering here?

00:12:56.500 --> 00:13:01.260
The four of us are going to do something together,
so we're meeting here to decide on the day.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:02.380
Oh, really?

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:03.470
What about you, Joro?

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.260
I just happened to be walking by.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:07.220
Oh.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:10.220
So when should we meet, President Cosmos?

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.600
My schedule is packed this week.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:15.480
President Cosmos is such a babe!

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.860
The new girl is beautiful, too!

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:19.610
Himawari-tan is cute!

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:21.730
<i>Emergency! Emergency!</i>

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.950
<i>Sergeant Kisaragi,
annihilate those women immediately!</i>

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:28.530
<i>We don't need any women
who are more popular than me around! Over!</i>

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.120
<i>Exterminate them! Destroy them!</i>

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.120
<i>Commander, don't forget the objective.</i>

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:34.460
I swear, our school is blessed with beauties!

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:38.330
That reminds me,
there's a cute first-year too, right?

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:39.340
Yeah, that's right.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:41.300
Um, her name is...

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:44.090
<i>This is the perfect chance
to increase the "Wata Guests"!</i>

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:46.800
<i>Sergeant, commence
the brainwashing mission as planned!</i>

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.890
<i>This is the first I've heard of such a mission.</i>

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:49.930
What's her name again?

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.810
I remember! Her nickname is Peenpopo!

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:55.310
<i>Not quite!</i>

00:13:55.480 --> 00:14:01.150
Bite off those boys' peenpopos immediately!

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.610
<i>The mission was a failure.</i>

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:04.780
SCIENCE LAB

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.740
They'll pay for that!

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.820
Those sons of bitches!

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:10.240
C-Calm down! It was just a mistake!

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:14.330
Peen— Tampopo, you're genuinely cute.
Somehow.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.080
All right, I'll forgive them.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.000
But only because I,
a living miracle, a superior angel,

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:25.630
am enveloped in kindness
and possess a lovely, compassionate heart.

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:29.260
She's an idiot. Also simpleminded.

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.600
Okay, let's talk about the next plan.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:35.980
Actually, I came up with a brilliant idea.

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.390
- Let's hear it!
- Yeah!

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:42.150
My awesome plan
will solve everything in one shot.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:43.730
What a buildup!

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.110
So what is it?

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:50.820
Playing the potential rival,
I'll confess my love to Pansy!

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:06.380
Hey, what happens
if she feels the same way about me?

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:09.970
That's possible, but it wouldn't be a problem!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.050
<i>I get it.</i>

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:19.230
<i>Soon. Soon all of my ambitions
will be realized!</i>

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:22.440
Hey, Tampopo,
let's put an end to this farce right here.

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:24.520
Farce?

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:29.700
I don't actually intend
to confess my love to Pansy today.

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:33.160
What was that?!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:35.160
Cool it, Commander Crazypants.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:38.200
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.370
A reason! Give me a reason!

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:44.540
From the beginning,
I only pretended to help you.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.880
I never actually meant
to bring those two together as a couple.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:51.260
So you're saying you tricked me?

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:56.100
You've got some nerve. You're the one
who lied to me not more than a minute ago.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:59.310
I-I don't have the faintest idea
what you're referring to!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:03.020
You can try to hide it,
but it was obvious from the start.

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:06.940
Remember what you first told me?

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.360
You were cheering on players

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:12.110
from Nishikizuta, the school you wanted
to go to, from the third base stands.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:14.620
I-I said that. So what?

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:17.580
At last year's final game
of the regional baseball tournament,

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:22.040
the Nishikizuta High School rooting section
was the first base stands.

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:27.840
You weren't cheering for Nishikizuta High,
and it wasn't the school of your choice.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:32.720
The truth is you were rooting for our opponent,
Toshobu High.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:36.850
But I'm at Nishikizuta High now!

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:40.720
And for the sake of the baseball team,
I'm trying to help Oga!

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:44.190
Silence, little girl!
As if you could save Sun-chan.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.730
I don't know.
But we can coexist.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.610
It hurts me to see you like this, Tampopo.

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.570
Your smoke and mirrors
aren't working anymore.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.410
H-Hanetachi!

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.450
Tampopo.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.200
On the day
of the Toshobu High entrance exam,

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:02.330
you had a bad cold and failed the test.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:04.710
That's why you came to our school, right?

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.420
H-How do you know that?

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:11.170
I asked some first-years about it,
and they were happy to tell me.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:15.430
I just shouted it out in frustration to myself!

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:18.510
So how could everyone know?

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.100
<i>Because you shouted it out.</i>

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:23.310
B-But going on that alone,
why would this be a farce?

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.730
Your true objective...

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:32.610
wasn't getting Sun-chan a girlfriend,
but getting Pansy a boyfriend.

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:34.990
How did you know?

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:40.160
I investigated
one more secret that you were hiding.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.870
O-One more?

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:49.710
Tampopo, you called Pansy a "beautiful girl,"
as if you didn't know it was her.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.380
Yes, but...

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.920
D-Don't tell me.

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:56.630
Yes. She's here.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:18:00.970
An upperclassman
from your middle-school days.

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:03.180
Long time, no see, Tampopo.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:06.390
S-Sanshokuin!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:11.150
Pansy, is this what
you looked like in middle school?

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:18.570
No. I went to school there in my true form.
Tampopo is fully aware of that.

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:19.820
There you have it.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:23.080
U-Um... uh...

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:23.990
Tampopo.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:28.210
You learned that I was at this school
during the Flower Dance, right?

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:29.460
Yes.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:36.260
Before that, you looked so different, I figured
it was just someone with the same name.

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.220
I see.

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:43.180
But you didn't want Pansy to know you were here,
so you enlisted me to act as your proxy.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:46.810
But there's no problem with the result, right?

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:51.520
Sanshokuin and Oga
are in love with each other! So—

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.070
That's incorrect, Tampopo.

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:58.450
The person I'm in love with
is Amatsuyu Kisaragi.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:01.870
The person by my side right now, Joro.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:06.040
I-It can't be.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.290
This Slipper Man?

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:10.540
That's right. Slipper Man.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.960
I-I don't understand.

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.500
You and this Slipper Man...

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:18.590
<i>Slipper Man thinks we could do
without this exchange.</i>

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.840
- Tampopo.
- What?

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.260
I'm not going to do anything, so just tell me.

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:28.520
Why did you want Pansy to have a boyfriend
so badly that you lied about it?

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:32.400
And why did you hide the fact
that you knew Pansy from before?

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:36.480
I think this wouldn't have been a problem
if you'd been honest from the beginning.

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:39.240
Th-That was, um...

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:44.200
You see, I lied to you, Kisaragi.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.580
But the truth is...

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.370
- I-I'm sorry!
- Wait! Hey!

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:51.750
- I'm guilty of being too cute!
- What's with her?

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:54.920
Joro, don't be too angry at Tampopo.

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.880
Why are you covering for her?

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:00.130
She was hiding everything out of kindness.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:05.260
I have unpleasant memories
of people saying things to me,

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:09.310
even pushing me into getting a boyfriend.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.730
Tampopo knew that, so she secretly tried

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:15.770
to make what she thought
was my wish come true.

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:20.400
Then, you went out with someone
in middle school?

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:21.900
Why? Jealous?

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:26.280
I know you've never had a boyfriend before,
so I'm not a bit jealous.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.960
So in the end,
what was Tampopo's scheme about?

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:33.420
I don't want to tell you, so I won't.

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:35.040
Is that right?

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.920
Thank you, Joro.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:40.300
It's fine, I just did what I wanted.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:41.130
Oh?

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:45.050
Okay, that's enough!

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:48.680
Leave the Tampopo case to me!

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:51.770
And you stay away from Joro, Sanshokuin.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:54.230
Too bad. It felt like we were having a moment.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:57.940
Oh, right. Thanks for everything, Asunaro.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:01.400
Not at all! I was happy to make myself useful!

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:06.950
Joro, do you like me better than Sanshokuin?
I'm more dependable.

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:13.910
Hanetachi, Joro prefers a kind girl like me
over a useful girl like you.

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:20.630
<i>Now's my chance.</i>

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.760
- Joro, about this...
- Yes?

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.510
I'll hold on to it.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:27.720
I don't think you need it.

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.930
What? That's my...
Don't take things from me!

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:34.690
Don't worry. I switched it for a different one.

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:36.690
A different one?

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:38.650
This is...

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:40.070
I-Is it strange?

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:40.980
No!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:43.860
I mean, it's fine.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:51.160
Please! Won't you change your mind?

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:54.830
Akino, even a plea from the president
of the student council is useless.

00:21:55.330 --> 00:21:57.960
It was decided in a faculty meeting.

00:21:57.960 --> 00:21:58.790
But that's...

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:00.750
As of this current term,

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:02.630
the school library will close.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
EPISODE 11
I MAY NOT BE NEEDED

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:38.390
I May Not Be Needed.
